    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Buggy proudly present this 127 Sqm, four bedroom detached family home in the highly sought-after Cross of Newtown development, a mature and predominantly owner-occupied residential community on the edge of Ballyroan village. The property enjoys a commanding location at the end of a cul de sac and offers generous accommodation, with large front and rear gardens.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented throughout, the home combines spacious and well-balanced accommodation with a bright and welcoming atmosphere, perfectly suited to modern family life.\r\n\r\nThe Cross of Newtown has become one of Laois’ most desirable addresses, renowned for its family-friendly environment, quality homes and strong sense of community.\r\n\r\nBallyroan Primary School, local Centra shop, service station and everyday amenities are all within walking distance, while school transport services and the Local Link bus provide excellent connectivity to Abbeyleix, Portlaoise and surrounding areas. Abbeyleix is just 4km away and Portlaoise can be reached in approximately 15 minutes, offering a wide range of shopping, dining, leisure and transport facilities.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from private gardens and off street parking, providing an ideal setting for families, entertaining or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a quality detached home in an established development where convenience, community and countryside living come together perfectly. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nThe Ground Floor comprises Entrance Hall with under stairs storage area, large Living Room, Kichen/Diner, Utility Room and Guest WC. Upstairs the are four bedrooms and main bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.2.m x 2m\r\nLiving Room - 4.5 m x 4.4 m\r\nKitchen - 6.5 m x 3.8m\r\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 2m\r\nGuest WC - 2.2m x 1.5m\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m x 2.9m\r\nEnsuite - 2m x 1.8m\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.2 x 2.8m\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.5 x 3.6m\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.4 x 2.6m\r\nBathroom - 2.3m x 2.5m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
