        "Content": "Family friendly estate\r\n350 Metres from Primary School\r\nSchool Bus to Heywood Community School from estate entrance.\r\nFully fitted bespoke kitchen\r\n10 Minutes - Portlaoise .. 50 Minutes - Dublin.\r\nBeautiful gardens \r\nHigh-speed fibre broadband"
